 "sentences": [
  {
   "sid": "2-06.s1",
   "text": "So how did we check all this?",
   "w_first": "2-06.w001",
   "w_last": "2-06.w007",
   "f0": 9,
   "f1": 128
  },
  {
   "sid": "2-06.s2",
   "text": "We read.",
   "w_first": "2-06.w008",
   "w_last": "2-06.w009",
   "f0": 162,
   "f1": 189
  },
  {
   "sid": "2-06.s3",
   "text": "A lot.",
   "w_first": "2-06.w010",
   "w_last": "2-06.w011",
   "f0": 202,
   "f1": 222
  },
  {
   "sid": "2-06.s4",
   "text": "No lab work of our own: this is a literature review.",
   "w_first": "2-06.w012",
   "w_last": "2-06.w022",
   "f0": 261,
   "f1": 454
  },
  {
   "sid": "2-06.s5",
   "text": "At the centre, one original study by Ren and colleagues in Chemical Science, 2023, with its supplementary data.",
   "w_first": "2-06.w023",
   "w_last": "2-06.w040",
   "f0": 495,
   "f1": 986
  },
  {
   "sid": "2-06.s6",
   "text": "Around it, the earlier Hong Kong study, papers behind two AI tools, a 2023 review, a textbook chapter, and a 2026 expert Perspective, which we read only as an abstract.",
   "w_first": "2-06.w041",
   "w_last": "2-06.w070",
   "f0": 1027,
   "f1": 2009
  }
 ],
